	(text "RF / ANTENNA LAYOUT:\nRoute RF paths as 50Ω controlled-impedance traces.\nKeep ANT1/ANT2 matching paths short and symmetrical.\nPlace matching components close to the nRF24L01P and\nfollow the recommended RF layout.\n\nUsed low-loss RF capacitors (C0G/NP0) for the matching\nnetwork. Maintain the specified ground-plane/keep-out\ngeometry around the RF section.\n\nCRYSTAL LOAD:\nCL1 & CL2 = 2 × (CL − Cstray)\nwhere Cstray includes PCB and IC pin capacitance."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 186.436 197.104 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
